  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Peacebuilding Strategies, Programs, and Initiatives Led by the Ministry of Interior in Colombia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Ministry of Interior, as spokesperson for the Government of Colombia to follow up on the implementation of the Final Peace Agreement, shows low effectiveness in the implementation and compliance of the Implementation Framework Plan (PMI). Thus, this Project seeks to contribute to the compliance of the Peace Agreement and the underlying commitments of the Ministry of Interior included in the PMI. For this, two components will be considered: the first seeks to improve technical capabilities for the construction and development of policy guidelines and peace strategies, in accordance with the competencies and capabilities of the Ministry regarding the PMI. And the second is for organizations and communities to put into practice the tools and resources provided by the Ministry of Interior for the promotion of social peace-building initiatives and projects.</narrative>
  </description>
